View Resolver:
==============
A Spring ViewResolver is an interface that maps a logical view name returned by a controller to an actual view, such as a 
JSP file or an HTML template. It handles the process of resolving this name into a concrete view implementation, often by 
using configured prefixes and suffixes to construct the full path to the view file, which keeps the controller code cleaner 
and more decoupled from the view's physical location. 

result


